-    *   For each training iteration:
-        a.  **Forward Propagation:** For each sample point $j$ in the table:
-            $$ I_j = \text{FeatureVector}_j $$
-            $$ H_j = \sigma(W_{in} \cdot I_j + b_{in}) $$
-            $$ U_j = \sigma(W_{out} \cdot H_j + b_{out}) $$
