-        b.  **Error Calculation:**
-            $$ E_j = U_j - L_j $$
-            $$ \text{Total Error} = \sum E_j^2 $$
-        c.  **Back-Propagation:** Adjust weights $W_{in}, W_{out}$ to minimize Total Error using the Back-Propagation Network (BPN) algorithm [S1, S2].
